<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>Dear&nbsp;{!Core_IPS_MAP_PAR__c.CreatedBy},</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;">You have successfully submitted the following Product Access Request (PAR):</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2" face="arial"><b>PAR #:</b> {!Core_IPS_MAP_PAR__c.Name}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2"><b>PAR Approval Org:</b> {!Core_IPS_MAP_PAR__c.Core_Support_Org_Name__c}</font></div><div><div><font size="2"><b style="font-family: arial;">PAR Submitter:&nbsp;</b><font face="arial">{!Core_IPS_MAP_PAR__c.CreatedBy}</font></font></div><div><font size="2"><b style="font-family: arial;">PAR Submitter Comments:&nbsp;</b><font face="arial">{!Core_IPS_MAP_PAR__c.Core_Submitter_Comments__c}</font></font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Each PAR can have multiple Line Items and each Line Item may or may not require approval.&nbsp; To review your Product Access Request and the approval status for each Line Item please: <a href="{!$Label.Core_IPS_Notification_Internal_URL}/{!Core_IPS_MAP_PAR__c.Id}">Click Here</a><a href="https://shnintelqacs44crm.intelqa.shnpoc.net/{!Core_IPS_MAP_PAR__c.Id}"><br></a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Note if you have created a PAR that was submitted to multiple Product Support Organizations you will receive multiple PAR notifications, one for each Organization.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: medium;"><div style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><b><font color="#666666">_______________________________________________________________</font></b></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="1" face="arial" color="#666666"><b><br></b></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="1" face="arial" color="#666666"><b>This message contains Intel Confidential information and should be handled in accordance with your Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) with Intel. Access to this e-mail by anyone other than the intended recipient is unauthorized. If you are not the intended recipient (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not use, copy, distribute, or deliver this message or any part of its contents or take any action in reliance on it, and in such case, you should destroy this message.</b></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="1" face="arial" color="#666666"><b><br></b></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: x-small; text-align: center;"></b></p><div style="background-color: rgb